{
 "_comment": "Undercity NPC bodies, read by tools/blender/build_npcs.py (schema and code defaults in npc_data.py; openspec/changes/archive/2026-09-28-npc-characters). One row per body model id; the game loads game/models/characters/<id>.glb. A named row pins its phenotype; a row with a seed is a civilian, and everything it doesn't pin is drawn from the seed inside civilian_range. Assets are MPFB asset names from the allowlisted packs (tools/deps/character_packs.json). MPFB sliders (muscle, weight, proportions, cupsize, firmness, race weights) are fractions 0..1. Colours are sRGB hex by named role; the looks follow the segmented figures these bodies replaced (tools/blender/characters.json, retired with them).",
 "out_dir": "bodies",
 "rig": "game_engine",
 "seed": 20260928,
 "atlas_px": 1024,
 "_comment_textures": "Atlas textures go into each glb as lossy WebP (EXT_texture_webp) at webp_quality, the glTF exporter's 0-100 quality: about 0.7 MB a body against about 4 MB with PNG. Godot 4.7 imports them (checked 2026-09-28).",
 "texture_format": "webp",
 "webp_quality": 85,
